/直博生（全日制）：</span><strong><span><span>材料与化工</span></span></strong><span>。欢迎全国各高校</span><strong><span><span>物理学、化学、材料科学、生物科学（含工程、技术）、光电、能源、化工、高分子、药学、环境和冶金</span></span></strong><span>等相关专业</span><strong><span><span>具有推免资格的2027届优秀本科生</span></span></strong><span>报名参加！</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/fvicoCuwP3cDJojnibZfraZWRnGLPYg7PxtmPL58icz5jLWs6a7TFFyY7Xm5caMyuhTscg1D54xsPDsZHCVibgjEOcpN6vibfaHa6BjXDshalfRQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>  二 申请条件  </span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、国内各高校物理学、化学、材料科学、生物科学（含工程、技术）、光电、能源、化工、高分子、药学、环境和冶金等相关专业2027届具有推免资格的优秀本科生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于前沿领域科研工作，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、诚实守信，学风端正，品德良好，无学业学术不端记录。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><sectio